SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] Technical Assistance for Recovery Community Centers RFF — due
DESCRIPTION:FSSA is asking for applications to provide technical assistance to Indiana's recovery community centers. If eligibility allows a TA or training vendor\, More Therapy could offer MORE training as part of that TA\, or join a lead applicant as a subcontractor. The fit is uncertain because the centers are peer-led.\n\nPath: Direct/Sub · Priority 1.0\nhttps://www.in.gov/sba/files/opportunities.pdf
